spans.s:
pṛcchati,
(1) requests, asks something to be done by another: bhagavato vandanaṃ ˚ti Mv 〔i.307.7〕, she asks (us to make) a salutation of the Lord;
(2) in mg. of Skt. āpṛcchati, says goodby: mātāpitṝṇāṃ mama vacanena pṛcche (2 sg. opt.) LV 〔231.17〕 (vs), say goodby to my parents in my name.
